    "notes": [
      "ABI1.1要求精确版本匹配；word地址，不是byte地址。命令word MSB-first。",
      "CMD_COMMIT最后写，值必须等于非零sequence_id；codec仅验证表示长度/uint32，不实现session/epoch/generation/sequence生命周期。",
      "VOICE_QUERY_INDEX必须按实际voice_count验证，不能缩为3bit；跨域查询生效后以status_generation首尾一致围栏读取generation与operator_count。",
      "Panic独立优先级通道；accept/completed不是同一状态；真实mailbox、CDC、稳定payload、BUSY、取消与PCM清理需RTL独立实现。",
      "SELECT_BACKEND期待旧session_id/epoch(boot0/1)，arg0为新非零nonce；RESULT/ACCEPTED/COMPLETED的SESSION/EPOCH和序号必须配对读取。",
      "同session+epoch中sequence严格递增不回绕；只允许最近相同载荷幂等重试，旧sequence返回STALE_SEQUENCE。NoteOn voice_generation为next current+1(0xffffffff后1)，其余voice命令匹配current。",
      "PANIC_SESSION和PANIC_EPOCH先写shadow，最后PANIC_SEQUENCE提交；codec仅语法验证允许transport0，生命周期语义由RTL验收。",
      "VOICE_QUERY_INDEX读回sysclk侧已经应用的query index；唯一设备写入owner序列化query。写索引后先轮询读回等于请求voice，再读取VOICE_QUERY_GENERATION/OPERATOR_COUNT并验证status_generation首尾相同；旧index不能因generation相同误判生效。",
      "Panic使用独立PANIC_RESULT_SEQUENCE/RESULT/SESSION/EPOCH与last请求缓存，不覆盖普通RESULT；PANIC_ACCEPTED/COMPLETED与此Panic身份在同一snapshot读回，仅最后Panic结果允许幂等重试。"
    ]
  },
